title: Design committed repository links local layers and typed obliteration
description: "Add native repository composition and lifecycle operations: committed links pin authorized repository and revision identities, local layers overlay an instance without changing commits, and authorized obliteration produces a typed payload state distinct from garbage collection, missing data or corruption."
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 2
